================================================================================
4. UPSTREAM DATA
================================================================================

The result table in this repository is derived from day-ahead and imbalance
prices published by the ENTSO-E Transparency Platform, converted to EUR at
European Central Bank reference rates. Those sources carry their own terms of
use, which are not altered by this licence and which apply to anyone
redistributing the underlying prices:

    ENTSO-E Transparency Platform  https://transparency.entsoe.eu/
    European Central Bank          https://www.ecb.europa.eu/

Nothing in this repository is trading advice.
